# Digital Intake & Consent Forms with E-Signatures

This plan introduces a versioned intake/consent form management engine. Staff can assign forms to patients, and families can complete and e-sign them from the Patient Portal. Signed records are captured with timestamp, IP address, and electronic signature, and are viewable in the patient's chart.

---

## Proposed Changes

### Database & Models

#### [NEW] [create_patient_forms_table.php](file:///c:/Users/User/Herd/bloom/database/migrations/2026_07_05_150000_create_patient_forms_table.php)
Create tables for tracking templates and filled instances:
1. `form_templates`: `id`, `title`, `description`, `type` (consent, intake), `fields` (JSON schema), `version`, `is_active`.
2. `patient_forms`: `id`, `patient_id`, `practice_id`, `template_id`, `status` (pending, completed), `form_data` (JSON), `signature_name`, `signature_ip`, `signed_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`.

#### [NEW] `app/Models/FormTemplate.php`
- Model definition with type casts for `fields` (array).

#### [NEW] `app/Models/PatientForm.php`
- Relationships: `patient()`, `template()`.
- Type casts: `form_data` (array), `signed_at` (datetime).

