## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
Create a new feature test `tests/Feature/PortalFormsTest.php`:
- Verify clinicians can assign a form template to a patient.
- Verify portal users can see pending forms.
- Verify portal users can fill out, sign, and submit a form (saving responses, IP, name, and timestamp).
- Verify clinicians can view the submitted form responses.

### Manual Verification
- Log in as provider, open a patient chart, and navigate to "Forms".
- Assign the "Telehealth Consent" template.
- Log in as portal user, navigate to "Forms", select the pending consent.
- Complete the form and sign it.
- Log back in as provider, verify it shows under "Completed" with the timestamp, signature name, and IP address.
